Buying food for two people was certainly tough on my\nwallet right now, but it wasn't so bad that we had to\nsustain ourselves with mere crumbs.%K%P
的确，如今我们两个人互相扶持，日子有些吃紧，\n但也并不是一筹莫展…%K%P
I was ready to cover her food expenses, but she kept\nrefusing all my attempts to hand her money.%K%P
而且，她的伙食费都是我出的，\n但对于除此之外的钱，她硬是不肯要。%K%P
