Despite having said that, Himeo's assertion was correct,\nstirring a contradictory feeling within my heart -- one\nboth pleasant and heavy with dark premonition.%K%P
虽然我嘴上这么说，\n但姬绪小姐对状况的分析是无误的，\n对此，我的内心既感到欣喜，却又感到焦虑。%K%P
I was glad she had grown up, but at the same time, it made\nme depressed to have her see through my tough front so\neasily.%K%P
欣喜的是看到她的成长，\n可是，商场如战场，这场苦战确实不易。%K%P
