Her most cherished friend, the one she swore to protect,\nwas in more trouble than ever before.%K%P
从未改变过，一直最珍重的美都子，\n面临着至今为止最大的危机。%K%P
Yet that same friend rejected Himeo and her attempts to\nhelp, only for the latter to end up being betrayed by her\nown family.%K%P
那么关键的时刻，心中一直描绘的\n『我来帮你』的美好图景，被妹妹无情地拒绝，\n被自己的亲人背叛。%K%P
Her feelings were surely in a state of turmoil, which\ncould've started affecting her health and not the other\nway around.%K%P
如今的她，内心在渐渐失衡。\n抑或是，内心的创痛，导致了身体的崩溃也说不定。%K%P
