那时的我…%K%P
...I found myself staring absent-mindedly at Himeo's\nflushed nape, captivated by its delicate contour.%K%P
只是呆呆地把目光，\n从姬绪小姐羞得通红的脸上移开了。%K%P
We were thinking the same thing...%K%P
因为…\n没想到，她竟然和我想到了一起…%K%P
