%LC理
\dOur study meetings for the new employees have already\nbeen successful twice thanks to Ms. Kinoshita's\nassistance.\d%K%P
「关于年轻职员的学习会，\n在木下小姐的帮助下，得以第二次实施了」%K%P
I didn't know how to feel about everyone's curious gazes\nand heartfelt wishes of luck. It made me wonder if\nsomething had recently escalated that earlier\nmisunderstanding even further.%K%P
虽然职员们都带着十分好奇的视线，\n用完全误会了的语气说出『请加油吧！』，\n对我进行了各种各样的非难…%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d...\d%K%P
「………啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
