After all, our company would fall into a severe financial\nsituation the moment we put this plan into motion. The\naccounting department could not afford to take something\nlike that lightly.%K%P
不管怎么说，这个决议通过之后，\n公司肯定会陷入一时的资金周转困难，\n所以也不能把会计忽视了。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dThen I suppose getting him on our side is going to be the\nmain goal when we meet the chiefs later today.\d%K%P
「要把他拉过来，\n今天的部长科长会议是关键呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYes, that's right.\d%K%P
「嘛，就是这样」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
