%LC理
\dHimeo!\d%K%P
「姫绪小姐！」%K%P
Yet all I could feel now was... frustration and anger.%K%P
为什么现在…\n我很生气，很辛酸，很难接受。%K%P
...And above all else, loneliness.%K%P
而且…更多的，是寂寞。%K%P
She was still... she was still too new to...%K%P
你还差得很远，不过是个新人而已…%K%P
She still had so much to learn -- according to my\ncalculations, we needed at least two or three more years\nto comfortably...%K%P
从今往后，你还要接着学习的东西，\n就我所知，也还要２、３年左右的时间，才能学得小有所成。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
