%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhat do you...\d%K%P
「这…到底是…」%K%P
Himeo's ambiguous smile seemed a mixture of\nmischievousness, affection, and wistfulness.%K%P
然而，姫绪小姐…\n对我投来了恶作剧一般的、可爱的…\n又混杂了无限寂寞之情的，微妙的微笑。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
