%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
After scolding her for acting too much like a clueless\nstudent all this time, I actually ended up forgetting that\nshe still was one.%K%P
一直以来，把她当作一个新人来教育的我，\n不知不觉，已经忘记了她原本只是一个学生。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dNo, I don't simply want to graduate. I'm planning to\nbecome someone far more useful than I am now. And there is\nknowledge that can only be gained at a university.\d%K%P
