%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
She possessed strength, hope, and potential -- the shining\nexample of a promising youth. Yet before I knew it, I got\nthe idea in my head that she couldn't do anything without\nme.%K%P
力量、将来、希望，明明她的这一切都如此闪耀，\n但我却不禁认为她总有一天会离不开我的。%K%P
In the beginning, I only intended to push her forward. Yet\nnow, I realized that I'd been holding her back just so I\ncould keep her close to myself... Not only at night, but\nduring the day as well.%K%P
想要作为她的后援，\n永远永远，把她置于手边…\n无论是漆黑凝重的黑夜，还是阳光闪耀的白天，都想和她在一起…%K%P
Before I knew it, I lost myself in my wish to monopolize\nher.%K%P
我只是一个，占有欲暴露无遗的『男人』。%K%P
