Even Vice President Yoshitomi, who never wasted an\nopportunity to share his long-winded opinions, was unable\nto get in a single word.%K%P
就连平日里，对工作没什么热情\n总是敷衍了事的吉富副社长，\n也饶有兴趣地认真听着。%K%P
