「怎么可能！\n我藏桥善十郎，老骥伏枥，志在千里。\n…无论如何，都得看到你出嫁了，我才能安心地闭眼啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dOh, that's quite a dilemma. Should I try to delay my\nmarriage as much as possible so you would live longer?\d%K%P
「哎呀，真是让我不好意思…\n那我，为了爷爷的健康长寿，\n可暂时就得忍着不结婚了么？」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dWhat? Are you saying you've already found someone?\d%K%P
「什么？\n那也就是说，已经有了相好的了？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dHah hah hah... I see! Now that's a surprise! And I could\nswear you were still wearing diapers just yesterday!\d%K%P
「哈、哈、哈…这样啊！呀，是让我吃惊啊！\n以前还裹着尿布的小姬绪居然都…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dSeriously! Bringing up ancient history over and over\nagain is one of the signs of senility, you know!\d%K%P
「够了啊！\n真是的，总念叨那些陈芝麻烂谷子，\n说明您上年纪了啊？」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dHm, wait... Now that I think about it, you were quite\nfriendly with that secretary you brought to the party the\nother day...\d%K%P
「不，等一下，上次宴会的时候，\n那个看起来和你关系相当不错，眉来眼去的秘书…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dAh, I didn't come to talk about that today! I need some\nserious advice! ...You are right, though.\d%K%P
「哎～今天就不要唠叨那些了！\n您认真一点儿吧！\n…虽然戳中了要害吧」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dAh, my apologies. So what's eating you?\d%K%P
「啊啊，我错了我错了。\n那，到底有什么事儿啊？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dAdvisor Kurahashi...\d%K%P
「藏桥顾问…」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dHm...?\d%K%P
「嗯…？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dToday, like back at the party, I come here as the\nManaging Director of Michihama Trading, and want to speak\nto you, the Sawashima Group's advisor.\d%K%P
「今天，在举行宴会的同时，\n我作为道浜商事的董事，\n有话想和泽嶋房地产的顾问谈一谈」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\d...Oh?\d%K%P
「…哦？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAchoo!\d%K%P
「阿嚏！」%K%P
Being unable to stave off my anxiety while waiting in the\nlobby of the hotel, I decided to step outside -- an idea I\nimmediately regretted, seeing how it was the middle of\nDecember.%K%P
难以忍耐在宾馆大厅内等待的焦躁感，\n我决定外出散步…真不愧已经是１２月的夜了。%K%P
From the station square, I could see the bright windows on\nthe top floor of the Triton Hotel -- the place where Himeo\nwas fighting the last of our preliminary battles.%K%P
从车站前的广场望去，就见特里同酒店最上层的灯光…\n姫绪小姐在那里，正在为最后的大决战纵横捭阖。%K%P
...Incidentally, I had to take out a loan to afford her\ndinner plans.%K%P
…多说一句，为了今天的会餐，\n我从久违了的消费者金融那里借款了。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
At the end of November, we convinced our company to follow\nour plan. After that, we only had to finish up our final\nnegotiations with a few other parties, and then...%K%P
１１月末，公司内部的意见取得了一致，\n剩下的，只有与最后的对手交涉，也就是今天的决战了。%K%P
Kurahashi Zenjurou. The former president of Central Bank,\nand now Chief Advisor to the Sawashima Group.%K%P
藏桥善十郎。\n原中部圏銀行的领导，泽嶋房地产顾问。%K%P
A man with terrible influence over the business world of\nJapan, including the Sundai Teiou JFK bank that was\ncurrently the Sawashima Group's main client.%K%P
他对现在泽嶋集团的主要业务银行，\n骏台帝王ＪＦＫ银行，具有极大的影响力。%K%P
Already over eighty years old, he could have been\nSawashima Junpei's father, and was the only known person\nwith authority to sway the magnate's opinion.%K%P
年过８０，虽然可以算作泽嶋顺平的父辈了，\n但依旧精神矍铄，也是唯一能影响他的人物。%K%P
As such, he would prove to be the central person in our\nupcoming plan as well.%K%P
正因为如此…他对于我们这次的作战，\n乃是最为关键的人物。%K%P
If we could only get him on our side, victory would be in\nsight.%K%P
说服了这位老人，\n我们的计划，就胜利在望了…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dA-A... Achoo!\d%K%P
「啊、啊…阿嚏！」%K%P
And so I prayed for our future -- a future for all three\nof us.%K%P
所以，我在这里为二人的…\n不，为三人的未来祈祷着。%K%P
This was a place marked by fate -- the very same place\nwhere Himeo and I took our first steps in this joint\nthree-legged race.%K%P
这里是，决一胜负的地方。\n也是姫绪小姐与我，两人三足，\n迈出最初一步的地方。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d...And that sums it up.\d%K%P
「…这些，\n就是事情的来由」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dFather appears to be hell-bent on moving ahead with the\nreconstruction of East Hagimori, even though the place\nholds many a memory for him as well.\d%K%P
「父亲他无论如何，也要推行东萩守的开发计划，\n不遗余力，坚定不移。\n…就算失去自己珍贵的回忆之所，也在所不惜」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dA forceful approach. Very much like him, indeed.\nBut it also sounds entirely half-baked, which seems very\nunlike him.\d%K%P
「那家伙就是这么个强人啊。\n而且，这次如此姑息，可真是不像他的风格啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dOur company has made several calculations regarding this\n\dEast Hagimori Reconstruction Plan,\d and no matter how we\napproach it, the project doesn't look like it would be\nprofitable for at least another ten years.\d%K%P
「父亲所说的『东萩守开发计划』，\n本公司计算过收支。\n…结果，得出了１０年之间都不可能盈利的结论」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dBut Junpei said he could do it, did he not? He has so far\nproven himself to be a man capable of making the\nimpossible possible.\d%K%P
「可是，顺平自己说过没问题的吧？\n他总是把我们认为不可能的事变为可能…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dDid he ever do that without first seeking your advice?\d%K%P
「他对藏桥顾问也什么都没有说吗？」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dMhh...\d%K%P
「唔…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dFather has clearly lost his ability to call the shots,\nand someone has to stop him.\d%K%P
「如今的父亲，已经明显地失去了以往的判断力。\n没有人阻止他怎么行呢」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dBut Himeo...\d%K%P
「可是啊，小姫绪…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI am a Sawashima of Michihama Trading.\nI would like you to keep that in mind for the time being.\d%K%P
「我是道浜商事的泽嶋。\n请您不要认错人」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dStill, I cannot simply endorse what you're doing.\nIt would need Junpei's approval.\d%K%P
「就算是那样，\n我也没有办法不认同他的计划啊。\n顺平自己最后的决断，才是最重要的」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d25% of our group's stocks belong to employees. By adding\nthe 10% of the Sundai Teiou JFK bank, 10% of yours, and\n10% of the other executives, we could achieve a majority.\d%K%P
「职员持有２５％的股份。\n还有骏台帝王ＪＦＫ银行的１０％，顾问的１０％，\n加上其他职员的１０％，这也就过半数了」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dE... Even if I could do something about the bank, there's\nno guarantee the other executives would follow me.\d%K%P
「银…银行这边我可以尽量帮你，\n可其他的职员」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI have already obtained the joint letter of authorization\nfrom each stockholder. If you join us, we would have 55%,\nwhich exceeds Father's 30% by a wide margin.\d%K%P
「这是全员持有股份的委任状。\n如果您同意了，那就是５５％。\n将会远超父亲的３０％」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dWhen did you have the time to...?\d%K%P
「…你，什么时候」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWhile everyone certainly appreciates Father as a fearsome\none man army, they also hold you in high regard as the one\nperson capable of stopping him when needed.\d%K%P
「大家都认为父亲太过于专断独裁，\n对于唯一能制止他的藏桥顾问，\n也给予了同样的评价」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dNo, that's not what I meant... Where did you find a\ncheeky bastard who managed to do all that behind our\nbacks? And so swiftly, even? It's almost like you had\nJunpei himself on your side.\d%K%P
「不，并不是那个意思…\n是谁，如此迅速而又强硬地出手了啊？\n简直和顺平的作风如出一辙」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
%XS10\dUh... Osamu would break out in tears if he heard that.\d %XE%K%P
「呜哇～，理先生听了，可真是笑不出来呢」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dI see... Very well. I can tell that you do stand a\nchance. This could indeed be the earthquake to shake the\nfoundations of our company.\d%K%P
「原来如此，我明白了。\n你们确实有很大的胜算。\n…或许会在集团内部，引起不小的震荡啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYes, and that's why I have another favor to ask of you.\d%K%P
「嗯，所以，我还有一事相求」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\d...What is it?\d%K%P
「…是什么？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI want your cooperation in case we win this -- to prevent\nthe company from tearing itself to pieces from within.\d%K%P
「在我们达到目的之后，请继续协助我们。\n未雨绸缪，阻止集团内部的动荡」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dHimeo...\d%K%P
「小姫绪…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYes, I'm Himeo from now on.\nPlease, Uncle... I want to make up with Dad.\d%K%P
「好了，接下来我就是姫绪了。\n呐，求您了，爷爷。\n我，想和父亲…重归于好」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAchoo! A-A... Achoo!\d%K%P
「阿嚏！啊、啊…阿嚏！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUgh... I didn't realize it was already so late.\d%K%P
「呼～………已经这个钟点了么」%K%P
The small arm of the station's clock was pointing at ten.%K%P
车站前的时钟时针，渐渐地指向了夜晚１０点。%K%P
The dinner was supposed to be over by nine, yet Himeo was\nstill nowhere in sight.%K%P
本来，晚宴９点钟左右就应该结束了的，\n但是却一点都没有姬绪小姐走下来的迹象。%K%P
I ended up going back and forth between the hotel lobby\nand the streets outside so many times the doorman began to\ngive me suspicious looks.%K%P
拜此所赐，我在大厅内外走来走去，\n渐渐地连警卫都注意起我来了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhat's going on up there...?\d%K%P
「怎么回事儿…」%K%P
Was she not coming back because they enjoyed each other's\ncompany... or because they were unable to find common\nground?%K%P
她到现在还没有回来，\n难道谈得正火热么…还是说搞砸了吗。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
Should I try going to the top floor to take a peek?%K%P
我要到最上层去看一看吗？%K%P
Perhaps I could be of assistance to her. After all, she\nwas facing off against an old wolf of a veteran who had\nseen more intense fights than all of us combined.%K%P
如果姬绪小姐，让那个饱览世事的老人，\n完全地占了上风，\n我就不得不去助她一臂之力了。%K%P
Himeo might have been Sawashima Junpei's daughter, but at\nthe end of the day, she was still a young university\nstudent.%K%P
因为姫绪小姐，虽说是泽嶋顺平的独生女，\n但毕竟还是个大学生。%K%P
This was no way for her to live her life; Himeo's time\nwould be better spent on club activities and charities,\nrather than trying to debate hardened businessmen.%K%P
本来，她应该去学习和参加社团活动，\n把志愿者的活动搞得有声有色，\n过着充实、优雅而无忧无虑的生活的…%K%P
Negotiations that would decide the fates of hundreds were\ntoo big a burden for her to shoulder alone.%K%P
然而如今，她却在交涉着１００个以上职员的前途命运，\n对原本的她而言，简直是太过沉重的负担…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo, I have to believe in her.\d%K%P
「不…我相信她」%K%P
Yet I would believe in her regardless.%K%P
但是，相信吧…%K%P
If only there was someone to support her...%K%P
任谁也好，能帮助她一把…%K%P
No, screw the impersonal examples...%K%P
不，那种一般的想法还是算了。%K%P
As long as I was there to support her, she could do\nanything.%K%P
她能做到，别说是我，任何人都做不到的事…%K%P
As long as I was somewhere close...%K%P
是啊，如果我在她身边…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I have to go!\d%K%P
「…果然我要上了！」%K%P
Without me around, she might not be able to unleash her\nfull potential! I had to hurry!%K%P
话说回来，\n我不在她近前的话，她可能无法把实力完全发挥出来。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dOsamu.\d%K%P
「理先生」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOh, Himeo! I was actually just on my way to see you!\d%K%P
「啊啊姫绪小姐，时候正好！\n现在我正想赶往你那边去呢！」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dReally?\d%K%P
「是么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYes, so please hang on for just a while longer.\nI'll be there to save you in just a moment!\d%K%P
「嗯，请你在那里稍稍等一下。\n我马上就去帮你！」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dUm, who are you going to save and where?\d%K%P
「就去帮我？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhy are you here?!\d%K%P
「为什么你会在这里！？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYou really do act weird sometimes, you know that?\d%K%P
「你还是偶尔说话让人听不懂啊」%K%P
I was worried, but I believed in her, but I was still\nworried... and when I was about to completely lose my mind\nover my own baseless worries...%K%P
关心她，相信她，可我还是担心着她，\n时而镇定自若，时而坐立不安，\n连自己都不明白自己该如何选择了。%K%P
...she came back to me, just like that.%K%P
结果，她就这样若无其事地，\n回到了我的眼前。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dU-Um... so how did it go...?\d%K%P
「我、我说，怎么样…？」%K%P
