%LC姫绪
\dHm? What?\d%K%P
「嗯？什么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHow did it go...?\d%K%P
「怎么样…？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dHow did what go?\d%K%P
「什么啊？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm going to burst a blood vessel if you keep doing this!\nTry to consider the time, the place, and the situation,\nfor the love of god!\d%K%P
「现在我很着急，我很生气啊！\n你装傻时，好好分清一下时间和地点啊！」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dAhaha... and there you go with your squeaky voice again.\nYou really do become quite pitiful whenever you get\nflustered.\d%K%P
「啊哈哈…原形毕露了原形毕露了。\n真是着急得风度全无了啊，亲爱的…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dTh-That doesn't matter right now... Ah...\d%K%P
「因、因为比起那个…啊…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI won!\d%K%P
「赢了～」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, ah...\d%K%P
「啊、啊…」%K%P
I had seen it many times in the past, but...%K%P
虽然至今为止看过很多次了…%K%P
...her beaming smile seemed more radiant than ever before.%K%P
但是，她至今为止从未如此闪耀，\n满面微笑，做出了胜利的手势。%K%P
And she also made our special sign of victory.%K%P
对了，我们表示胜利的手势，不是Ｖ字…%K%P
Three fingers, all pointing up.%K%P
食指，中指，还有无名指…%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dThe three of us will be able to stay together. We managed\nto achieve each and every one of our objectives.\d%K%P
「三个人…还能在一起了呢。\n因为对我们来说，这一切都大功告成了」%K%P
The proof of us being as one.%K%P
这是我们三个人在一起的证明。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHimeo...!\d%K%P
「姫绪…小姐」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dKyah?! A-Ahaha... Ahahaha!\d%K%P
「呀啊！？\n啊、啊哈哈…啊哈哈哈哈」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThank goodness... thank goodness... you did so well...\d%K%P
「太好了…太好了…\n真是辛苦你了！」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dNm, nmm... Pwah.\nHaha, hahahahaha.\d%K%P
「嗯、嗯…啊、呜啊。\n嘿嘿、嘿嘿嘿嘿嘿」%K%P
I rewarded her efforts with a heartfelt embrace.%K%P
我用力地把她横抱了起来，仿佛要折断她的身躯一般，\n毫不吝惜地给予了她赞美与奖励。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI should've known not to expect any less from you, Himeo!\nI know I've raised you right!\d%K%P
「不愧是…不愧是姫绪小姐。\n我培养你真是值了！」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dMy, isn't someone being a tad too haughty there? I'd say\nit's my childhood circumstances that came in handy today.\d%K%P
「别介，声音大得太夸张了啊。\n今天的胜利，明明是我带来的～」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut I was the one who taught you how to make use of\nthem!\d%K%P
「这一套是我教会你的～」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dThat's right.\nYou taught me everything about how to abuse my power.\d%K%P
「对啊～，是你教会我的呢～。\n都是些争权夺利的法子～」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAs long as it's for the greater good!\d%K%P
「结果不是大获全胜了么～」%K%P
We were laughing and dancing in the middle of the street,\nno doubt getting in the way of many a passerby.%K%P
在依然人来人往的车站前，\n我们纵声大笑，紧紧地抱在了一起，难舍难分的我们二人，\n一定给过路的人带来了很大的困扰吧。%K%P
But we didn't care, at least for a few more moments.%K%P
即便如此，仅仅这几秒钟，\n我们无视了给众人带来的困扰。%K%P
%LCHimeo
