「什么？」%K%P
Because we have...%K%P
因为，我们…%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWhat would you say to not doing anything else for today\nand just sleeping together like two logs until the\nmorning?\d%K%P
「今天，我们两人，要在一起一直到早上，\n………什么也不做，也不睡觉好吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOh, good idea! That sounds heavenly!\d%K%P
「这主意不错啊。简直就像狂欢一样！」%K%P
After all, we'd barely had any time to sleep lately.%K%P
能走到今天，\n都是多亏了这几天之间，不眠不休的努力啊。%K%P
