December 22, 200x, 10AM.%K%P
２００×年１２月２２日\n１０时００分%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\d...What?\d%K%P
「…你说什么？」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dI'll ask again: what is the meaning of this?\d%K%P
「所以啊！\n请您告诉我，到底是怎么一回事！」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dI don't understand. Start from the beginning.\d%K%P
「听不懂你在说什么。\n给我按顺序好好说」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dI have just returned from the signing ceremony between my\ncompany and the Shikijo Corporation.\d%K%P
「就在刚才，签字仪式结束了。\n是敷城公司与我们城西建物签的约」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dRight, it was today...\nLike I promised, you are now part of our Group.\d%K%P
「是吗…\n那就按照约定，你们公司，已经是集团的一员了」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dWas it your trap all long?\d%K%P
「…莫非，这一切都是您布下的陷阱吗？」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dI thought we'd already agreed on the terms. The name of\nyour company might disappear, but the project will live\non. The development of East Hagimori will be yours.\d%K%P
「收购的条件，我想双方都互相确认过了。\n公司名称注销，企划仍旧保存。\n东萩守的开发，就一手…」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dIs it possible you really don't know anything?\d%K%P
「…您真的，什么都不清楚吗？」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dMy patience is running thin.\nExplain what you're talking about.\d%K%P
「这是怎么回事儿？」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dMichihama Trading's President Hamazaki, Vice President\nYoshitomi... and Managing Director Sawashima were all\npresent at the signing ceremony.\d%K%P
「签字仪式上…\n道浜商事的浜崎社长与吉富副社长…\n对了，还有泽嶋董事，都一起出席了」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\d...What?\d%K%P
「…什么？」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dAs I was taken by surprise, Ms. Sawashima approached me\nand told me that the Shikijo Corporation was merging with\nMichihama Trading, and would begin a joint operation come\nJanuary of next year.\d%K%P
「吃惊的倒是我啊，泽嶋小姐是这么告诉我的…\n『敷城公司，在１月１日与道浜商事合并，\n以“道浜商事”为新公司的名称，重新开始运营了』」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\d...Wait, what's going on there?\d%K%P
「………等等，这是什么意思？」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dYou really don't know...? Haha...\nAre you not even aware of what's happening to your own\ncompany?\d%K%P
「您难道一无所知吗…哈哈…\n这到底是什么家里蹲集团啊！」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dW-Watch your tone...\d%K%P
「你、你丫…」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dLike I care at this point! I've unwitting ended up\nbecoming your daughter's minion! And the entire East\nHagimori plan has been put on indefinite hold.\d%K%P
「我才不管您有多可怕呢！\n我啊，已经可喜可贺地成了您女儿的部下了！\n自不必说，东萩守的开发也见鬼去了！」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dHimeo...? How did she do that...?\d%K%P
「姫绪她…？\n怎么会…」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dLook... I'm going to tell your daughter all about your\nschemes and hope she won't run me out. I'll agree to all\nof their conditions.\d%K%P
「知道吗？我从现在开始，就把您打的所有算盘，\n全都和您女儿交代以求她的原谅了！\n对方提出的条件，我也会全部接受！」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dW-Wait...\d%K%P
「不、不…等等」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dWait for what?! Right now, my boss is your daughter!\nYou've got nothing to do with me anymore! At this point,\nI've no choice but to join her!\d%K%P
「等什么！\n我的老板，已经是您女儿了！可不是社长您了哦？\n我已经向您的女儿宣誓效忠了」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dHimeo... wait, that doesn't make sense.\nThere's no way she could do that to me.\d%K%P
「姫绪她…不，她不可能做得出来。\n那家伙居然，把我玩弄于鼓掌之中…」%K%P
%LC???
%LC？？？
\dYou really think so?\d%K%P
「那可不一定…」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dHuh?!\d%K%P
「哎！？」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dWell, -thank you very much- for all your hard work until\nnow. If you have any other business with me, forward all\ninquiries to your daughter.\d%K%P
「既然如此，一直以来承蒙您照顾了！\n今后有什么命令，\n就请和您的女儿通报一下吧！」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
%LC???
%LC？？？
\dAre you busy?\d%K%P
「不知所措了吧？」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dNo, I've just finished, Chief.\d%K%P
「不…已经结束了。\n…总管」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dYou're still calling me that?\nI haven't been Chief for a decade now.\d%K%P
「你也该改改叫法了。\n我不当总管，已经１０多年了」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dWhat is it? It's unusual to see you here.\d%K%P
「怎么了啊？\n您来这儿可真是不多见」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dWell, hmm... I thought you could use my advice.\d%K%P
「不，嘛嘛…\n有些事想跟你谈谈…」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dYour advice? I currently have nothing to...\d%K%P
「谈谈？\n但现在也没什么问题啊」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dFor example, regarding your beloved daughter and her\nnewly-manifested rebellious phase...\d%K%P
「比如说…\n以前十分可爱的女儿，如今到了反抗期的年纪，\n作为老爹，该如何是好这类的…」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dYou've had your hand bitten, and now can't seem to decide\nwhether to scold or praise her... Whether to crush or\nacknowledge her efforts.\d%K%P
「被轻轻地咬了一下手，\n是该斥责还是夸奖，是该制止还是该鼓励呢…」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dChief... could it be...\d%K%P
「总管…莫非…」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dBut it was you who started this, and forgiving her might\nnot be enough to stop her. Not the most enviable situation\nto be in, all things considered.\d%K%P
「可是，事先布置好了机关，\n现在想要求原谅，对方也不会轻易理解吧。\n不，陷进去也很难吧」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dI see... So this is how that ridiculous merger could\nhappen without my knowledge...\d%K%P
「我什么情报也没得到，\n如此荒唐的公司合并就通过了，原因就是这个么…」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dUnder normal circumstances, that would have never\nhappened. You were so preoccupied with your backdoor\nschemes that you forgot to keep an eye on the front, eh?\d%K%P
「平常是不可能的吧。\n…你总是躲在背后，没有注意到表面的征兆吧？」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dYou lost, Junpei.\nYou'd better give up on East Hagimori.\d%K%P
「这次是你输了啊，顺平。\n放过东萩守那片地区吧」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dLost? What is that supposed to mean?\nI have countless ways of turning this around.\d%K%P
「输了？输了是什么意思？\n我还有很多特别的反击技巧…」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dRefusing to admit your defeat will only make you look\nmore and more pathetic. Himeo has seen through your\nintentions.\d%K%P
「你就不要再苦苦支撑下去了。\n你打的那些算盘，小姬绪已经毫无遗漏地都看透了」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dMy intentions...?\d%K%P
「我打的算盘…？」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dYou were trying to turn the whole district upside-down as\nan excuse to adopt a single orphan girl.\d%K%P
「你啊…\n为了收养那个失去母亲的邻居小孩，\n居然如此费尽心机，大费周章…」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dAh?!\d%K%P
「啊…！？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d\dToko will have nowhere to go if they take her house\naway. And he's planning to use that as a pretext to move\nher to his place in Nagoya.\d\d%K%P
「公寓要是不在了，\n小都子就无家可归了。\n然后，她就会被带到名古屋去吧」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dThat girl from next door... Right, I recall Junpei\ntelling me that she was the first baby he ever carried.\d%K%P
「邻家的女孩吗…\n说起来，我的确听顺平念叨过。\n『抱过一个刚出生的婴儿』什么的…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dApparently, he was too caught up in his work around the\ntime I was born. By the time he came to see me for the\nfirst time, I was already three months old and had hair...\nwhich seemed to have surprised him.\d%K%P
「听说我那个时候…他工作很忙。\n出院三个月之后，才第一次看到她，\n头发都已经长出来了，让他很吃惊…」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dHe regrets that to this day.\nAmongst many other things.\d%K%P
「他也对那时的事很后悔…\n不，那之后，越来越悔不当初，越来越积重难返」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYes, I've realized that myself. He tries to put on a\nstern appearance around me, but there are few parents more\nindulgent than him.\d%K%P
「嗯，到了如今，我也明白了。\n父亲虽然表面上对我很严厉，\n但实际上，真的很宠爱我」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\d...You certainly have a keen eye. He kept his true\nfeelings locked away, and I thought he'd carry on being\nmisunderstood to the grave.\d%K%P
「…你终于察觉了啊。\n那是个死傲娇的家伙，\n结果一直让小姬绪误解了啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI only realized that through coincidence.\nI mean, his plan was just too similar.\d%K%P
「察觉到这一点，真的是偶然。\n因为这次，和父亲所用的招数，真的很相似呢」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dToo similar? To what?\d%K%P
「相似？\n什么相似？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫緒
\dTo my own attempt at claiming Toko for myself.\d%K%P
「我想要把小都子接过来时的做法」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dTake the land, get rid of the tenants... Use every dirty\ntrick in the book to save the girl, regardless of how much\nit costs, while also making sure no one but me suffers any\nactual loss.\d%K%P
「控制土地，把居民赶出去，\n无论用多么卑鄙的手段，都要把她拯救出来…\n完全不在意金钱。除了自己，谁都不受损失」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dAh, that definitely sounds like him. It's not that he was\nsimilar to you.\nYou simply took after him, Himeo.\d%K%P
「啊啊…这倒是顺平的处事风格啊。\n他的确和小姬绪很像。\n小姫绪和他呀，简直就是一个模子刻出来的」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d...I am his daughter, after all. I learned much from\nhim.\d%K%P
「…因为我是他的女儿啊。\n而且也接受了父亲的教育」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dJunpei, you see... becomes far too lenient and indulgent\nwith those he acknowledges as family. On the other hand,\nhe shows not a shred of mercy to his enemies.\d%K%P
「顺平他啊…对自己的亲人，如同春天般温暖。\n不过，他对敌人也是如冬天般无情」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dBut... Dad is making a mistake right now.\nI know because I realized I was making one as well.\d%K%P
「可是…这次父亲他错了。\n而且，之前我也犯了错误」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dToko wants neither money nor an easy life.\d%K%P
「小都子所追求的，\n决不是富裕而悠闲的生活」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dOh? Then what does she want?\d%K%P
「哦？\n那又是什么呢？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dA treasured place with treasured people...\d%K%P
「在心爱的地方，有着心爱的人…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dThings might occasionally be tough, but as long as\neveryone helps each other...\d%K%P
「不管再苦再累，只要大家在一起互相扶持…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d...they'll find happiness in each other's arms and\neventually forgett about everything that caused them pain\nand suffering.\d%K%P
「守望着小小的幸福，每个人都欢笑着，\n苦难与艰辛，不知不觉就会忘掉…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYou can't buy that with money. You don't need money.\n...Well, I guess it's good to have a little, but not too\nmuch. That's the M.O. over at East Hagimori 3-24.\d%K%P
「用钱买不到，也不需要金钱…\n不，想要的话，只要稍稍一点就好了。\n那就是，东萩守三丁目２４番地」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI think it'd be nice if East Hagimori 3-23 became as\npleasant a spot as it is over there.\d%K%P
「我觉得，\n东萩守三丁目２３番地，也能成为那样一个幸福满溢的地方」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dI see.\d%K%P
「这样啊…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dSo please, Uncle... Stop Dad.\d%K%P
「所以我求您了。\n爷爷，让爸爸收手吧」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dLittle Himeo...\d%K%P
「小姫绪…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI'm confident we can make up.\nAfter all, everyone wishes for the same thing here.\d%K%P
「不管是谁，期望的都一样，\n请您一定要说服他，让我们重归于好，我相信您」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\d...And this is how I became an ambassador in this little\ngame.\d%K%P
「…事情就是这样了，\n我这次来，是来当个亲善大使的」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\d...Chief.\d%K%P
「…总管」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dLittle Himeo was pretty close in her assessment, I'll\ngrant her that, but she still didn't get to the core of\nthe issue.\d%K%P
「小姬绪她，真是了不得啊，\n虽然还有些天真吧」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\d...What do you mean?\d%K%P
「…什么意思？」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dThere was another big reason why you went after the\nkids.\d%K%P
「你对那些孩子们多管闲事儿，\n还有一个很重要的理由对吧」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\d...!\d%K%P
「哎…」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dPeople were right to claim that love was blind. One might\njudge everything with a cool head, but completely forget\nto put themselves into the equation.\d%K%P
「不，算了…恋爱就是让人盲目啊。\n即便能够冷静地分析周围的情势，\n却还是无法察觉自己如今的所思所想」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dPlease stop...\d%K%P
「我求您不要再说了…」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dThat Himeo... It sure makes a man feel old.\d%K%P
「小姫绪啊…\n老夫也上了年纪啊」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dI told you to stop!\d%K%P
「都说了，求您别说了…」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dFew fathers would go to such lengths to scare away their\ndaughter's boyfriend.\d%K%P
「费尽心机，用上一切能用的手段，哪怕卑鄙无耻，\n无论如何也要拆散他们的老爹，也真是不多见了」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dHe's almost thirty! Not to mention he's already been\ndivorced once!\d%K%P
「那可是３０岁的男人啊！\n而且他还离过婚吧！？」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dHeh heh heh... hahahahaha...\d%K%P
「噗噗噗…噗噗噗噗噗…」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dHimeo is still young. It might not sound like much coming\nfrom her father, but she took after her mother in terms of\nbeauty! You'll never find a more diligent and affectionate\ngirl than her!\d%K%P
「我的女儿姫绪，正值芳龄，\n和她母亲很像，是个出类拔萃的美女，\n非常认真，努力不懈，极其富有慈爱精神，非常的温柔！」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dWah hah hah hah... hahahahahaha!\d%K%P
「哈哈哈哈哈…呜啊～哈哈哈～！」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dShe has money, influence, and youth! She could choose any\nman in the world, so why would she go for a... for a...!!\d%K%P
「有钱！有地位！还有青春！\n比起其他人来，简直是百里挑一！\n为什么、为什么看上了那么一个…那么一个～！！！」%K%P
%LCZenjuurou
%LC善十郎
\dWell, if she still ended up falling for a man like that,\nI suppose the only explanation is that she's seriously in\nlove.\d%K%P
「嘛，迷上了那么一个男人，我说，\n那可是小姫绪发自心底的爱慕之情啊。\n呜啊哈哈哈哈哈哈」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dThat's no laughing matter!\d%K%P
「这可没什么好笑的！」%K%P
December 23, 200X, 10:07 PM.%K%P
２００×年１２月２３日\n２２时０７分%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYay! I have electricity! The lights work!\d%K%P
「呜哇啊啊啊～！\n来电了来电了终于来电了～！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dTry not to get too excited, Ms. Can't-Handle-Alcohol.\d%K%P
「安静一点儿吧，你难道喝醉了吗」%K%P
%LCHimeo
