Did anyone at Michihama Trading and Shikijo Corporation\neven suspect our true objective?%K%P
道浜商事的人…\n敷城公司的人…\n得知了我和姬绪小姐的真实目的，又会作何评价呢。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dNonetheless, Osamu... You can value yourself however you\nwant, but I have absolute confidence in everything you\ndo.\d%K%P
「即便如此啊理先生…\n不管你对自己如何评价，\n我对你是全盘支持与肯定的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHimeo...\d%K%P
「姫绪、小姐…」%K%P
Seriously...%K%P
真是啊…%K%P
If our past selves -- particularly Himeo -- overheard this\nconversation, they'd likely pass out from shock.%K%P
如今的我们，审视那个时候做的事…\n尤其是姬绪小姐的所作所为，简直是目瞪口呆…%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI mean, you did everything for a person that means the\nworld to me... Well, and probably for me as well, just a\nlittle.\d%K%P
「因为我，是为了最爱的人…\n是为了小都子而奋斗。\n而且…或许、多少有些，是为了我自己」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHer well-being... means a lot to me, too.\d%K%P
「那个…\n你对我来说，也无可替代」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI know...\d%K%P
「嗯…」%K%P
Although, she was certainly undervaluing her own\nimportance.%K%P
虽然比重和她所说的，有些不同，\n但意思大抵上是一样的。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI am the representative of the Sawashima Group, with\ncomplete authority over all business matters presented to\nme by Sawashima Junpei himself.\d%K%P
「我是泽嶋房地产的代表董事，经由泽嶋顺平委任，\n全权处理这里的事务」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHuh?\d%K%P
「那个…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dIn other words... my word is my father's word.\nAnd I acknowledge all your actions as correct.\d%K%P
「也就是说…\n我所认同的，父亲也同样会认同。\n你做了对我来说的正确之事，对吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIn that sense, I suppose I haven't really won against\nSawashima Junpei, after all.\d%K%P
「也就是说…\n结果我还是没能战胜泽嶋顺平啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYeah. If he had considered you a genuine enemy, you would\nnever have made it this far.\d%K%P
「对啊。\n你若是真的与父亲对敌，肯定会败下阵来」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI guess I still have a long way to go.\d%K%P
「我还差得很远呢」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWell... you're still young.\d%K%P
「那是…因为你还年轻」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Are those your honest feelings?\d%K%P
「…你真的这么觉得？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYup, you're totally young!\nJust look at how your...!\d%K%P
「年轻年轻！\n这里还这么硬挺…啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhoah?! W-Wait, if you start moving like that...!\d%K%P
「呜啊啊啊啊！\n喂、喂喂…这么突然动起来…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dAh, ah... G-Geez, th-that part of you... is really young\nand lively...!\d%K%P
「啊…啊、啊…真、真的是…还很年轻呢…啊」%K%P
